cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "OpenPrice API"
abstract: >-
  API that serves historical prices of crypto-assets reconstructed from on-chain data (Uniswap, SushiSwap, Curve,
  Chainlink) with a source hierarchy, a confidence index and a provenance record from which a third party can
  recompute the index.
authors:
  - family-names: Augusto
    given-names: Stéphane
    affiliation: "HES-SO, HEG Geneva, Deep Mining Lab"
repository-code: "https://github.com/DeepMining-Lab/openprice-api"
url: "https://fair.deepmining.ch/"
license: MIT
version: "3.1.1"
date-released: "2026-11-17"
keywords:
  - on-chain data
  - historical prices
  - decentralized exchanges
  - confidence index
  - provenance
  - reproducibility
